Prerequisites

• You must have RubyGems 2.4.1 or higher. To find your RubyGems version:

shell
gem --version


• You must have bundler 1.6.4 or higher. To find your Bundler version:

shell
$` bundle --version
Bundler version 1.13.7


Authenticating to GitHub Packages

[!NOTE]
